# Awaken the Honored Dead, chapter III (ruling 2025-04-04): the reflexive ability's target is chosen as it goes on the stack, so
# "you may choose the card you just discarded". The graveyard holds only Sol Ring, Black Lotus and Mox Ruby (chapter II's mill),
# so the Swamp Bot1 discards is the only creature or land card there and the only legal target, which is chosen without a question.
# The Swamp is returned to the hand it was discarded from: Bot1 ends with the same five Swamps it would have had without discarding.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Awaken the Honored Dead
Mox Pearl
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Awaken the Honored Dead.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Choose(Swamp)
Bot2.Pass
[T7 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Mox Pearl; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Awaken the Honored Dead; Mox Ruby; Black Lotus; Sol Ring
Stack.Count = 0
